  "title": "Trex Company Appoints Zachary C. Lauer As Chief Operations Officer",
  "summary": "WINCHESTER, Va.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 4, 2026-- Trex Company, Inc. [NYSE:TREX], the world’s largest manufacturer of wood-alternative composite decking and railing, and a leader in high-performance, low-maintenance outdoor living products, today announced the appointment of Zachary C. Lauer as Senior Vice President, Chief Operations Officer.",
